From a918313845035eb5e3f179c14139599efceae2b8 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Juuso Alasuutari <juuso.alasuutari@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 29 Sep 2026 09:53:17 +0300
Subject: [PATCH 4/5] layer: integrate with dlsslopd and add the in-layer
 network

This commit adapts layer.cpp to dlsslop-amd: it starts and talks to
dlsslopd, offers device-local transport, repaints idle frames, handles
HDR swapchains, and runs the Vulkan network inside the layer on request.
It also serializes the layer's queue work with the game's queue
operations and device waits.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
